    "en": "Package of activities about chess. We can find 6 sections : \n<ul> \n <li>Introduction </li>\n <li>The chessboard </li>\n <li>The pieces </li>\n <li>Algebraic notation </li>\n <li>How to move the pieces </li>\n <li>Basic lessons </li>\n</ul>",
